{{!
    @template local_mooblox/play

    Shell of the full-screen world: the client mounts into the root and reads the JSON config.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * configjson - JSON config for the client, HTML-safe encoded
    * bundleurl - URL of the client module bundle

    Example context (json):
    {
        "configjson": "{\"wwwroot\":\"https://example.com\",\"courseid\":2,\"sesskey\":\"abc\",\"firstname\":\"Mia\",\"avatar\":\"\",\"rev\":1}",
        "bundleurl": "https://example.com/local/mooblox/client/dist/mooblox.js?rev=1"
    }
}}
<div id="mooblox-root" class="local-mooblox-root"></div>
<script type="application/json" id="mooblox-config">{{{configjson}}}</script>
<script type="module" src="{{bundleurl}}"></script>
